cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the SuPreM models or the AbdomenAtlas dataset, please cite all four papers below."
title: "SuPreM: a suite of 3D medical segmentation models supervised-pretrained on AbdomenAtlas 1.1"
abstract: "Official implementation and pre-trained checkpoints for SuPreM, a suite of 3D medical image segmentation backbones pre-trained with full supervision on the AbdomenAtlas 1.1 dataset of 9,262 annotated CT volumes."
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/MrGiovanni/SuPreM"
url: "https://github.com/MrGiovanni/SuPreM"
